  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facilitating the Social and Labour Market Inclusion of Displaced Ukranians Residing in the Regione Lazio, Italy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to fostering the social and labour market integration of populations displaced from Ukraine (Ukrainian and non-Ukrainian citizens) benefitting from Temporary Protection status as per Directive 2001/55/E and residing in the Lazio region.</narrative>
  </description>
